1. The Design has been given, but be innovative, make the application as smooth as possible
2. Use MCP, langchain and Sub agents to  achive context as high as possible
3. Create apps in html, javascript, typescript and scss when possible. if using images try to find and use a imagemagick command or other tools, convert it to svg if it makes sence,
NEVER run blocking server commands (node server.js, pnpm start, etc.) - provide commands for user to run separately.
